@startuml
title Cd Player State Machine

[*] --> Stopped

Stopped --> Playing : insert disc / press play
Playing --> Paused : press pause
Paused --> Playing : press resume
Playing --> Stopped : press stop
Stopped --> [*] : no more discs

Pausing --> Playing : press play
Resuming --> Playing : press play

Stopted --> Paused : press pause  // added transition to reach Paused state
Paused --> Stopted : press stop   // added transition to reach Stopted state

@enduml
